/* Simplified Chinese strings of the 4.3in LCD UI (app_lcd_ui_small.inc).
 *
 * Keyed by the exact English text, so strings of other modules (local
 * control messages, stop reasons, drive states) translate too.  A format
 * string keeps the same conversions in the same order (test_lcd_ui checks
 * it; the format_arg attribute of SmallUi_Tr makes the compiler check the
 * English one against the arguments).  A Chinese character is two text
 * columns wide; the two table headers keep the English width so the
 * columns below them still line up (also checked by test_lcd_ui).
 *
 * Numbers, units and established abbreviations (Kp, Kd, TCP, RPY, CAN, IP,
 * PC, MCU, J1-J8) stay as they are.  After changing a string here, run
 * /usr/bin/python3 tools/gen_lcd_zh_font.py to update the glyphs. */

